  DATA: ls_velin2_old TYPE lty_velin2_quan,
        lf_tabix_2    TYPE sytabix.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <y_item> TYPE vepovb.

* begin of note 2984970
  DATA: ls_header type header51,
        ls_tvlk type tvlk.

* check the delivery type
  call function 'V51P_GET_HEADER_DATA'
       IMPORTING ES_HEADER51 = ls_header.

