*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*is there a material item in table "it_items" with the given "if_venum"?
*YES, and it belongs to delivery "if_vbeln"              -> ef_subrc = 1
*YES, but as "if_vbeln" is initial we leave when         -> ef_subrc = 1
*     we find the first material (performance)
*YES, but it doesn't belong to the delivery "if_vbeln"   -> ef_subrc = 4
*NO, no material item                            -> ef_subrc = unchanged
FORM delivery_in_hu USING    if_venum TYPE venum
                             if_vbeln TYPE vbeln
                             it_items TYPE hum_hu_item_t
                    CHANGING ef_subrc TYPE sysubrc.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <item> TYPE vepovb.

  READ TABLE it_items TRANSPORTING NO FIELDS
                      WITH KEY venum = if_venum
                      BINARY SEARCH.
  CHECK sy-subrc IS INITIAL.
  LOOP AT it_items ASSIGNING <item> FROM sy-tabix.
    IF NOT <item>-venum = if_venum. EXIT. ENDIF.
    CASE <item>-velin.
      WHEN '1'.
        IF <item>-vbeln = if_vbeln OR if_vbeln IS INITIAL.
          ef_subrc = 1.
          EXIT.
        ELSE.
          ef_subrc = 4.
        ENDIF.
      WHEN '3'.
        PERFORM delivery_in_hu USING <item>-unvel if_vbeln it_items
                               CHANGING ef_subrc.
        IF ef_subrc = 1.
          EXIT.
        ENDIF.
    ENDCASE.
  ENDLOOP.
ENDFORM.                    "delivery_in_hu


